          <span class="text-amber-400 transform group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform text-xl">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          Shackle WLL ratings are for inline pulls only. Side or angular loading reduces capacity — refer to ASME B30.26 derating tables. For multi-leg rigs, calculate tension per leg with our <a href="/sling-angle-calculator" class="text-amber-400 hover:underline">Sling Angle Calculator</a> before selecting a shackle.
        </p>
      </details>
